          "docs": "Adds a document item to a board by selecting file from device.<br/><h3>Required scope</h3> <a target=_blank href=https://developers.miro.com/reference/scopes>boards:write</a> <br/><h3>Rate limiting</h3> <a target=_blank href=\"/reference/rate-limiting#rate-limit-tiers\">Level 2</a><br/>"
        },
